          <div style="font-weight:700; color:var(--text-primary); margin-bottom:0.4rem;">🌐 CloudPages & Web</div>
          <p style="font-size:0.85rem; color:var(--text-secondary); margin:0;">In landing pages, preference centers, form processors receiving URL parameters, and confirmation pages.</p>
        </div>

